   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing prices",
     "texto": [
      "To compare two prices you can use **plus cher que** (more expensive than) and **moins cher que** (less expensive than / cheaper than).",
      "The structure is **plus/moins + cher/chère + que**: **Ce sac est moins cher que cette veste**. The adjective agrees in gender and number: **un sac moins cher**, **une chemise moins chère**, **des chaussures moins chères**.",
      "At this level, it is enough to recognize and use these expressions when shopping."
     ],
